flowchart TD

    Start["👤 用户输入复合指令 (User Input)"]

    subgraph AgentLoop ["🔄 Agent 思考-行动-观察自治闭环 (LangGraph 状态机)"]
        Think["🧠 LLM 综合上下文与消息流水线深度思考"]
        Decide{"需要调用外部工具吗？"}
        CallTool["⚙️ 执行目标工具 (Weather / Calculator / Search)"]
        Observe["📋 Observation: 将工具结果作为 ToolMessage 写回消息列表"]
        
        Think --> Decide
        Decide -- "需要工具" --> CallTool
        CallTool --> Observe
        Observe --> Think
    end

    Start ==> Think
    Decide -- "无需工具 / 信息已充足" ==> FinalAnswer["🎉 最终汇总并回答用户 (Final Output)"]

%% Academic palette: restrained blue, teal, gold, violet, and coral accents.
style Start fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3A6EA5,color:#17324D
style Think fill:#E7F5F1,stroke:#2B8A78,color:#17324D
style Decide fill:#FFF4DC,stroke:#B47A1F,color:#17324D
style CallTool fill:#F0EBFA,stroke:#7357A6,color:#17324D
style Observe fill:#FCE9E6,stroke:#B65C4A,color:#17324D
